              "t": "07:00",
              "speaker": "Grandfather",
              "en": "As Grandma says, good health matters. We are ordinary people, and I often tell her that we should learn to appreciate what we have. I do not like the idea of being completely satisfied, because who ever feels that every wish has been met? But we can learn contentment. That takes thought, with both the mind and the heart.",
              "zh": "正如奶奶所说，身体健康最重要。我们是普通人，我常对她说，要学会知足。我不太喜欢“满足”这个说法，因为谁能觉得自己的所有愿望都已经实现了呢？但人可以学会知足，用头脑和心灵认真体会自己已经拥有的东西。",
